    editorPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
  - guid: 622449c4-ac0b-46ae-9e22-bf19ae1917b9
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: And when did you get here, man?
      delaySeconds: 0.4
    editorPosition: {x: 260, y: 0}
  - guid: cf7e2343-e75e-4eb6-8f30-f8753e8191e7
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: To Erlin's Eye, that is.
      delaySeconds: 2.1
    editorPosition: {x: 520, y: 0}
  - guid: 3df79c5f-60b9-4dca-ac94-d19b49775b0e
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: Does it get any easier?
      delaySeconds: 1.9
    editorPosition: {x: 780, y: 0}
  - guid: 8e638dd6-0d17-4379-9190-1be58822f4b1
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: I've been here a few days now, and still just as clueless as when I got here.
      delaySeconds: 1.8
    editorPosition: {x: 1040, y: 0}
  - guid: fb116229-2f4f-4ca4-a92f-8b38931ca425
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: It's strange, this place feels like home, yet I recognise nothing at all.
      delaySeconds: 3.8
    editorPosition: {x: 1300, y: 0}
  - guid: 81263e13-65b8-4a08-9063-9012622cbdcd
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: But, at least I know you now. And, this stall gives me refuge.
      delaySeconds: 3.6
    editorPosition: {x: 1560, y: 0}
  - guid: 3502e363-382e-4eaf-a8d0-a8c0987734c4
    kind: 4
    line:
      text: 
